From 2cd9d3d794991c4946414593e31468a70e35fabd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:24:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): a viewport Pick through toggle lets picks reach the
 far side

The nav column gains a "Pick through" button, off by default and drawn
as off. When on, viewport feature picks send `through: true`, so a click
can take an edge or point behind the near surface. It is view state like
the axes toggle, not an undoable command (docs/decisions/692-pick-through-mode.md).

Refs #692

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
